{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1366,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13931c914d4a947ad0a9873b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有规则和禁忌的束缚，\r\n我的道路由我自己决定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad7e5bb603d0fc5b034ee3b20c8d19d339115bf8d0c51951981484e42f6925b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64c520b5fbd447a1ef01e56f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有我可以帮忙的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd1ebb77540ae3214b7e2ff9e4962cfb8a41099f044b99a73d5dc1aa8e4fd40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:230bdc1923e137eca86e994c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感到无所不能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16ea6db429bba4dc39298de8873f26ad8d8b28ed497fb0c7c6762b6aecee8240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1057",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfba1707225e8cbdeb606c59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麻烦你了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "5821ab28e7b7a9ae9e0fa604b63c55093c3571f60d31b0cabffb55455ee25937",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ee87494c4bc9859d90eeb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来我也有优点……\r\n训练员的话，\r\n真的给了我很大的鼓励……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23fbd878ea695f05c394da47b1663bf8f0772cd67f677a0f081e235e334c86e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cbffe101e9dead0e4dd5e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "い、行ってきます…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31da5591be773abe0b77a2dc99bb251a9eb42a39df67a1b89d89823584cbde26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef79acbf8c3b8310287271d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "た、ただいま戻りました…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2024eb0577a1dd3a52be94afd730f8a4ad64dc3172f79e9cce29ed439ec06e15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c55a8ac6292d59ca842ccb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员在一起时的我……\r\n就会稍微有点信心……\r\n就会稍微有点，喜欢的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfb7f69c68847cdec27df99c54dba31e0e9c23f87f13a246e88f6634566ac38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596adaddd500c928ed5f26d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是这么一个容易出状况的人，\r\n你也还是接纳了我、相信我……\r\n谢、谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "055b172b88e89c2e1c76c9a2013a006d2944b39d0b8b6938fcfe0cea62cd5301",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb6318a4a715a06e6cc5341e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "板羽球真的好困难……\r\n我每次挥的时机都慢半拍，\r\n没多久就满脸墨汁了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "686ef6bcd92065e814e03611ed3910ff152b376f9f0e0d69bd0cdcc9bd4a35fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fdc8b33290c1869275960c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自己做了巧克力……\r\n但帮我试吃的神宫却晕倒了……\r\n我该怎么办才好～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a0ffdd4d8cec1817928225421737b283ecf1c8aee345460403600b6f6ec7fff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e405081807c533811e2ebb0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请、请问……你想吃巧克力吗？\r\n虽然我……很不会做菜，\r\n但还是勉强完成了一个……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40db7c0b851a2e67269b9df7e6ac88b26a4ef62cfc1a96d100b563a26d96609",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24ea0e7b0f32331771a9a81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在签纸上写好了愿望～\r\n……虽然忘记写上自己的名字，\r\n但还是会实现的……对吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "06fa34df8de2ec0e5001be8dbd0ea8ffe9f4b9a626ed7cf9683000d01951228a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2f706bcfcaf2448ba06331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？今天是万圣节！？\r\n我问一下……训练员你……\r\n应该……不会恶作剧吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "884f2519ca6a2ff2248a8d4f1021e10fc08cab8f49040539e4edee491a15ba0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:152f0cb0365921b4367ed34b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说圣诞老人当中，\r\n也有像我这样的冒失鬼……\r\n……好想要认识一下哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdaa016e448b4a6fdbc3319f032d50b8d1db561fbf7e10e253c7b4e3ee3979f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daaac8d7c1bca28ddb62b463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要送给训练员的礼物……\r\n我没有忘记带出来哦！\r\n晚点你愿意收下吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "293e857ff3b95be1ec4b138efe6b07e34624fd1220f0677d11ce2838663b721b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8438e654e173336f5bb84d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这并不是在做梦吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e91b6d414e47271dfe8f7f9bc214b117e3e5a3fb914a393516e06f3ac8edf18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b72caf24a5b5a421f1668b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除的时候，\r\n我总是会越整理越乱呢……\r\n每次都只能交给神宫去做……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9a37302bbd2fa76e0db9113414ee717d6e47546e0961550b82edc28c86b69ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2a7ab1854e38afc01ff33d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐～\r\n为了让你能有安稳的一天，\r\n我会乖乖躲在角落里的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "de75baf59849528b82300682da6762b3e5a1431cfb8760924ad9e8e49b9977e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cfb8948a7ac1d6dcdef0c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得的生日你还愿意跟我在一起……\r\n真的很谢谢你。\r\n我、我会认真帮你庆生的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "798b7cc04c775d4b2c335e14f1cfc0ccb711ec8da10d63fa0c06409da888a68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c99f47d6d62808e0b4685b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日是这样的我也能变主角的日子，\r\n也是能获得很多祝福的……\r\n幸福的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782b331a5778ea899b7b6aab12e43004962a4b0eb799dc419e5ab35f7aeed7b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec128d6eaa7737bd9890e66d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要、要送给我的礼物？呜呜……\r\n你记得我的生日，\r\n就已经是最棒的礼物了说～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d074bd8e96249e3136f92d2787548e1674b09e4506c3040b2754d3ca9e060b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7975b7fd84404c59a1b2e6e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有新的公告呢～\r\n……我很容易就忘记去看内容，\r\n所以一定要好好确认才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "312ca24a1cfd47de736fd5c441ae7a4eb5e4bfcd2eb037557da7d581e5decee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c5b4032c2b64aca0e4d273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物咯～\r\n好像都没有跟我一样\r\n忘记写送件人名字的耶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a40ff5d7604e28317bac28ad9310c6dee826fc3aa6af4ac41ded41167b2e4af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7d1e999e4f705eb9ee7f99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成，恭喜你～\r\n训练员果然很厉害呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c0789b6a53f13278f632b3d2023cee749eff8f6b8c20d8a490335128756887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199308de3cf3b736d31708db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就、就快要有活动了呢……\r\n希望当天可以不要给人惹麻烦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67078b3b20fe3abc57840c235cf298a6b3064bc9d50fbc9756b44c177b1a9af3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b3a886e44257b43f140a28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像正在举办活动哦～\r\n只是稍微偷看一下的话，\r\n应该不会妨碍到别人吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "774396ad3335b18dd5cfa6e92b4a85dbe4bda9aa55d4d796ac4252e1d0523063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c795cfcd4e290fe5c6332b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎……怎么这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cc07e22efb559722ada244ebed8a3a518467a09030290605acb892f6659839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b937b3347e948c729b7de5c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃……\r\n赛马娘名鉴的等级好像提升了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f4d98490f4a5a333971c6991c29de62688936d95ea11d43711b3f50ec1ea3d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ad83021408b324e3ec47c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勇気を出して花柄を選んで\r\nみたんですが、派手過ぎましたかね\r\nはぅ、ごめんなさいぃ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f304e353f104aa201ed6e82550b6453c7127d0b983b9f19ca549f7479c21d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b44d15738d304ec9f98bc14e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このスカート、前に猫ちゃんが\r\n載ってくれて…また来てくれたら\r\nいいですねぇ～…えへへ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f84c3577bb8260a72cb08267d903fde8a6722ab78cb1c2bafcd22d4c55f78d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d2ec70c42c971da6dc06b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "動物園のヤギさんに、お花の柄の\r\nところをかじられたことがあって…\r\n本物じゃなくてごめんなさいぃ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff93d1e4c853d5acc7ae0389d629af30c9e3763bf8fc17e0b1bafbd8d652ff5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a56f8f3f89807eacf7ce22e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感情很好……的感觉？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cf32f3551555eeab1ac1430478c8db2c1077bcb5739b051b6b9373766e9658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:583d6a1d9d33fb5f6c5625d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是大家的功劳……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6222d050993c39a888e5e7efdcea3ec1a529ec12382edae06a03d4d92ae806c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1e9faa8781b0332a3e0de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎……怎么这样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65cc07e22efb559722ada244ebed8a3a518467a09030290605acb892f6659839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6acc7e8fd76347856d528a5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感情很好……的感觉？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29cf32f3551555eeab1ac1430478c8db2c1077bcb5739b051b6b9373766e9658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df8f8768c44f3e5855eb9ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "创、创下高分纪录了～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4bf46abf0480f487141a26c20016bc380c572bc2f0d263e13a1371952df1cd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:854c861c2e1e82d3e5180221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那就……一起好好努力吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2411038b902f726d032587ad67242e1159e0e670774de5b2b7aa8d6e3c276bae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca3bb4a8651cf9251dae10d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深感惶恐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18fbd36570de1321deb7cea21dc265baf355527cfc7bf29c8f8531cabd2c417",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a72fa3e9d05138a01fa3da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "027b814497c414b0dbfbb1d98428e2115f22c192e11011830b2a6d6720770894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8d2736c2e56e5c4d13df32e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素滴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e55caf64ba23ef1c5d2d00319072a3cd0f9775f6ba7b10e310ae634b18a54a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21cfbf18b8f98b62bda5235d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:698239edbba1b4af46921f9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请问……\r\n今天要做什么样的训练？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ed5a3963005cb7b6d465841c1f4de50fdd202c6dec7908b9f93a80359768953",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67ad4cf8e31e003c3b660df6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有很多有趣的故事～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eae494b20d9ce2f7acddce5a7818260dbb647153be95fec4d18ab949e90c9c9",
