      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be1d4dc97819dc67e452abb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得自己今天的状态好像不错……\r\n所以想要尝试很多东西……\r\n可、可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b15ee1d3279cb2066681eba34c82e1b4280b1356ec77637eafaff84145269f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80de84179a62f3fc3b35fee2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态好的时候是很珍贵的……\r\n我想要做一些\r\n趁现在才能做到的训练……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d49b2eb4915a64a3a0a00f9adf8d070c1c57484db7f8b955f48f47a61f406c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d63dee218bb3e3a2092b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……要不要去角落一点的地方？\r\n我这种人还占用大空间训练，\r\n感觉很不好意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1fe328f189e58be1f0c030c6fa1fac8f2855fb49b8809abe723e39a0d334945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20006"
